[00:00.000] 作词 : 文雅/羽·泉
[00:01.000] 作曲 : 羽·泉
[00:09.700]
[00:40.200]吞噬我吧夜的黑
[00:46.400]醒在想你的边陲
[00:53.100]日子过得像杯白水
[00:59.100]没有了你淡而无味
[01:06.100]
[01:06.100]回忆有一万分贝
[01:12.200]吵到我无法入睡
[01:18.800]爱过谁能全身而退
[01:24.800]是你让我感情残废
[01:34.200]
[01:34.200]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely
[01:41.300]So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna run away
[01:47.200]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
[01:54.200]世上的人那么多
[01:57.500]最爱失去哪一个
[02:00.100]
[02:00.100]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely
[02:07.200]So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna run away
[02:13.200]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
[02:20.100]念旧的人最寂寞
[02:23.500]愚蠢的爱
[02:28.600]最深刻
[02:32.400]
[02:43.300]不管下一个是谁
[02:49.600]你要幸福听到了没
[02:56.000]我不在乎这会不会
[03:02.000]在你看来接近虚伪
[03:08.300]
[03:08.300]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely
[03:15.300]So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna run away
[03:21.300]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
