[03:31.300]最爱失去哪一个
[03:34.000]
[03:34.000]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in lonely
[03:40.900]So lonely lonely lonely don't wanna run away
[03:47.000]Yes I'm alone alone alone alone in loving you
[03:54.100]念旧的人最寂寞
[03:57.400]愚蠢的爱
[04:02.700]最深刻
[04:08.800]
[04:11.200]“谁羽争锋，泉力出击”
[04:15.800]“羽泉地带，没你不行”
